1312:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
1313:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the TIM PWM Time Base according to the specified
1314:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         parameters in the TIM_HandleTypeDef and initializes the associated handle.
1315:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
