2622:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
2623:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the TIM One Pulse Time Base according to the specified
2624:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         parameters in the TIM_HandleTypeDef and initializes the associated handle.
2625:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
2626:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2627:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
2628:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_OnePulse_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_OnePulse_Init()
2629:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in One Pulse mode, timer
2630:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
2631:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
2632:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM One Pulse handle
2633:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  OnePulseMode Select the One pulse mode.
2634:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
2635:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_OPMODE_SINGLE: Only one pulse will be generated.
2636:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_OPMODE_REPETITIVE: Repetitive pulses will be generated.
