7501:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TI1 as Input.
7502:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral.
