7508:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
7509:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7510:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_DIRECTTI: TIM Input 1 is selected to be connected to IC1.
7511:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_INDIRECTTI: TIM Input 1 is selected to be connected to IC2.
7512:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_TRC: TIM Input 1 is selected to be connected to TRC.
7513:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICFilter Specifies the Input Capture Filter.
